{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11202430","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11202430","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1120243001:0":{"text":"흠, 어찌됐든 쿠긴은 실력은 조금 부족해. 게다가 부족 안에서 지지 기반도 약하고…","source_cn":"不过不管怎么说，库金的实力应该还欠点火候。在族内的根基...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37BF74DB2886E685","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1120243002:0":{"text":"난 다르게 생각하네. 쿠킨은 잠재력이 있는 젊은이네.","source_cn":"我倒觉得，库金是个很有潜力的年轻人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D87BF9C5172803A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1120243003:0":{"text":"미래는 젊은이들의 것이지. 나이가 들면 고집이나 세지지. 요즘 것들은 그런 걸 보고 꼰대라고 한다더군.","source_cn":"未来终究是属于年轻人的。人上了年纪啊，就容易变得固执和...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF44A91EF2B98D104","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120243004:0":{"text":"블랙하울에도 젊은 지도자가 나와야 하지 않겠나.","source_cn":"黑嚎也是时候该出一个年轻的领导者了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B3057F96011AC66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:担忧的黑嚎中年":{"text":"걱정스러워하는 중년","source":"担忧的黑嚎中年","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:智慧的黑嚎老者":{"text":"지혜로운 노인","source":"智慧的黑嚎老者","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}